## What these scopes must produce

The figures the L4 encoding asserts, in `ofek-cases.l4`:

| scope                              | expected     | what it exercises                                     |
| ---------------------------------- | ------------ | ----------------------------------------------------- |
| `YaelInSeptember2024`              | 11 008.03    | table, Tosefet Ofek, § 39 supplement over its floor    |
| `YaelInNovember2025`               | 10 903.453715| § 9(a), the 0.95% reduction                            |
| `YaelInNovember2025HavingAdvanced` | 10 773.453715| § 16 withholding stacked on § 9(a)                     |
| `YaelOnHalfAPost`                  | 6 004.38     | § 39(b) — the supplement is NOT pro-rated              |
| `DvoraInOctober2026`               | 18 673.689801| two supplements, § 22 units, § 9(b)'s 1.2%             |
| `NoaInSeptember2024`               | 5 000.9875   | § 36(d)(2) doctorate 5%, on half a post                |
